  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "How large is 5654 Woodland Sage Dr?",
      "a": "The home has 2,631 heated square feet with 5 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, a loft, a bonus room and a 2-car garage, on a 146-foot-deep homesite in Promenade Estates, Sarasota, FL 34238. It was built in 2020 with concrete block construction."
    },
    {
      "q": "What is the HOA fee, and is there a CDD?",
      "a": "The HOA is $268.25 per month and there are no CDD fees. Community amenities include a pool, splash park, tot playground, basketball and sand volleyball courts, a fitness center and a dog park with separate small- and large-dog areas."
    },
    {
      "q": "Does the home have a private pool?",
      "a": "No. The home does not have a private pool; residents use the Promenade Estates community pool and splash park."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which schools serve 5654 Woodland Sage Dr?",
      "a": "The home is zoned for Laurel Nokomis School (K-8) and Venice High School, and the community school bus stop is a short walk away. Pine View School, a gifted program with eligibility-based admission, is about 3 miles away. Confirm current zoning with Sarasota County Schools."
    },
    {
      "q": "How does Florida's Amendment 3 affect a buyer in 2027?",
      "a": "Amendment 3, approved November 3, 2026, raises the homestead exemption on non-school property taxes to $150,000 in 2027 and $250,000 in 2028. Homestead status is based on ownership and permanent residence on January 1, with applications due March 1. Owners who were not permanent Florida residents on December 31, 2026 receive the current exemption until their fifth year of exemption.",
      "expires": "2026-12-12T00:00:00-05:00"
    }
  ],
